   "author": "Mai Magcuro",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "6 months ago",
   "text": "Great place to have coffee and dessert ❤️🥰 place is very cozy and the hot chocolate is a must to order and the panda ice cream cake.  Had our free teddies turned into a flower accessories in the flowershop outside muzn ❤️",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Sara B",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "a month ago",
   "text": "You can tell they really care about what they do. This is easily one of my favorite spots, and I’ll definitely be back. Delicious food, a cozy atmosphere, and friendly, attentive service make this cafe an absolute must-visit!\n\nHighly recommend to anyone looking for great food, great coffee, and a great vibe.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "dana alhosani",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "a year ago",
   "text": "I ordered takeout from this café and everything was perfect! The food was delicious, the service was quick, and the packaging was neat. On top of that, the prices were super reasonable for the quality. Definitely a place I’ll be ordering from again!",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "MZ L (Malcleavius)",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "2 months ago",
   "text": "A fantastic hidden gem in Ajman for families. The desserts and sweets are absolutely incredible—pure indulgence! My only wish is that they would bring back their sugar-free ice cream options.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
