   "text": "The sweets i tried (Um Ali, Panda cake) was great 👍🏻\nThe coffee they are serving (Brazilian beans) test nice\nVery busy place more for take away than dine in at least after midnight during Ramadan.\n\nI really recommend this cafe (5 🌟)",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
